Master MuJoCo Keyboard Demo

Movement:
  8 / 2 : forward / backward
  4 / 6 : move left / move right
  7 / 9 : turn left / turn right

Upper body:
  O / P : head left / head right
  K / L : waist left / waist right

Other:
  5     : LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH speed
  0     : recenter all joints and stand
  Space : stop movement and stand
  R     : reset head and waist
  Esc   : exit

